      "id": "A1",
      "severity": "major",
      "file": "core/config_ui/__init__.py",
      "line": 3615,
      "summary": "Apply the stale-record judgement to console rendering too",
      "evidence": "The new check runs only inside start_runtime(). _console_response() still uses running_state().alive, which checks PID liveness alone. For a stale status record naming a reused live PID, the console therefore renders STATE_UNSUPERVISED, and _controls_markup() provides no Start button. Users remain blocked from starting through the UI; the new tests bypass this by calling start_runtime() directly.",
      "confidence": "low",
      "basis": "inference",
